# AGENTS.md maintenance (agent / kanban skills)

When you **edit** any file under `.cursor/skills/agent-*/` or `.cursor/skills/kanban-*/`:

1. **Read** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) § **Maintaining AGENTS.md (routing guide)** in the same turn (before handoff).
2. If the skill edit changes routing, card types, turn lifecycle, handoff format, or area→skill mapping → **update AGENTS.md** per that table in the same turn.
3. Handoff **Context load** must say `AGENTS.md current`, `AGENTS.md updated`, or `AGENTS.md stale: …` — not omit the check.

**Files used** must include `AGENTS.md` with `(read)` or `(edit)` when this rule applied.

Does **not** replace [agent-self-evaluation.mdc](agent-self-evaluation.mdc) §2b check 4 on other turns — it **adds** a hard read when these skill paths change.

**Broader parity:** same-turn updates to triage, rules, and reference tables → [agent-consistency.mdc](agent-consistency.mdc).
